# No CDN / no runtime internet assets

The browser must load the app **only** from our origin (and same-origin `/api`).

1. Do **not** link Google Fonts, jsDelivr, unpkg, CDNs, analytics, or remote CSS/JS.
2. Fonts live under `front/public/fonts/` and are referenced with local `/fonts/...` URLs.
3. CSP must not allow `fonts.googleapis.com` / `fonts.gstatic.com` or other third-party hosts for assets.
4. `connect-src 'self'` only (API via same host `/api`).
5. User-clicked outbound links (GitHub, Maps/taxi) are OK. Prefetching or embedding those resources is not.
6. GTFS feeds are **server-side** only (API container), never fetched from the browser.
